116
00:09:03,230 --> 00:09:08,230
naturally favors strategies that preserve
future flexibility over those

117
00:09:08,230 --> 00:09:12,669
that eliminate options. There's a
statistical tendency where power

118
00:09:12,669 --> 00:09:16,389
seeking behaviors tend to be optimal
across a wide

119
00:09:16,389 --> 00:09:20,480
range of possible objectives. This
behavior emerges from basic

120
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:24,200
logic rather than human like desires for
dominance. To

121
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:27,039
