the

258
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:36,680
value determined by the likelihood of
winning. The transition

259
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:41,480
from tools to agents amplifies all other
dangerous capabilities

260
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:48,279
through autonomous optimization. Agency
itself isn't inherently risky. The

261
00:19:48,279 --> 00:19:52,720
danger emerges when goal directed behavior
combines with other

262
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:58,519
capabilities. An agentic system with
deceptive capabilities can engage

263
00:19:58,519 --> 00:20:04,670
