Agency plus situational awareness

264
00:20:04,910 --> 00:20:09,789
enables systems to behave differently
during evaluation versus deployment.

265
00:20:10,509 --> 00:20:14,230
Agency enable systems to actively optimize
for their own

266
00:20:14,230 --> 00:20:19,789
preservation and capability enhancement,
potentially including resistance to human

267
00:20:19,869 --> 00:20:25,710
oversight. Unlike tools that humans
directly control, agents pursue

268
00:20:25,710 --> 00:20:31,180
objectives autonomously, creating the
possibility of optimization processes that

269
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:35,940
work against human interests. The
fundamental shift is from

270
00:20:35,940 --> 00:20:40,740
systems that execute human specified
instructions to systems that

271
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:44,619
interpret high level goals and determine
their own methods

272
00:20:44,619 --> 00:20:48,619
for achieving them. A transition driven by
inexorable economic

273
00:20:48,859 --> 00:20:51,579
incentives rather than deliberate choice.
